{"id":"proprium.dominica-iv-adventus-evangelium","title":"Anno quintodécimo impérii Tibérii Cǽsaris","category":"proprium","section":"missa-catechumenorum","variant":"dominica-iv-adventus","sung":false,"st":"working-edition","ad":5,"adw":6,"about":{"pl":"Ewangelia IV Niedzieli Adwentu. Łukasz datuje rok siedmioma urzędami naraz — cesarz, namiestnik, trzej tetrarchowie i dwaj arcykapłani — i dopiero potem mówi, że słowo Boże przyszło do człowieka, którego wśród nich nie ma.","en":"The gospel of the Fourth Sunday of Advent. Luke dates the year by seven offices at once — an emperor, a governor, three tetrarchs and two high priests — and only then says the word of God came to a man who holds none of them."},"seg":[{"id":"s01","type":"verse","speaker":"sacerdos","voice":"clara","w":[{"i":"w001","f":"Anno","l":"annus","m":29},{"i":"w002","f":"quintodécimo","l":"quintusdecimus","m":101,"h":"w001","a":5},{"i":"w003","f":"impérii","l":"imperium","m":68,"a":7},{"i":"w004","f":"Tibérii","l":"Tiberius","m":54,"a":7},{"i":"w005","f":"Cǽsaris","l":"Caesar","p":",","m":69},{"i":"w006","f":"procuránte","l":"procuro","m":201,"h":"w007"},{"i":"w007","f":"Póntio","l":"Pontius","m":29},{"i":"w008","f":"Piláto","l":"Pilatus","m":29},{"i":"w009","f":"Iudǽam","l":"Iudaea","p":",","m":141},{"i":"w010","f":"tetrárcha","l":"tetrarcha","m":320,"a":13},{"i":"w011","f":"autem","l":"autem","m":15},{"i":"w012","f":"Galilǽæ","l":"Galilaea","m":64},{"i":"w013","f":"Heróde","l":"Herodes","p":",","m":109},{"i":"w014","f":"Philíppo","l":"Philippus","m":29},{"i":"w015","f":"autem","l":"autem","m":15},{"i":"w016","f":"fratre","l":"frater","m":109},{"i":"w017","f":"eius","l":"is","m":27},{"i":"w018","f":"tetrárcha","l":"tetrarcha","m":320,"a":13},{"i":"w019","f":"Iturǽæ","l":"Ituraea","p":",","m":64,"a":7},{"i":"w020","f":"et","l":"et","m":15},{"i":"w021","f":"Trachonítidis","l":"Trachonitis","m":13,"a":7},{"i":"w022","f":"regiónis","l":"regio","p":",","m":13},{"i":"w023","f":"et","l":"et","m":15},{"i":"