 się proste, a drogi wyboiste — gładkie. I wszelkie ciało ujrzy zbawienie Boga.","en":"He went throughout the whole region of the Jordan, preaching a baptism of repentance for the remission of sins, as it is written in the book of the sayings of the prophet Isaiah: A voice of one crying in the wilderness: Prepare the way of the Lord; make His paths straight. Every valley will be filled, and every mountain and hill brought low; the crooked will become straight, and the rough ways smooth. And all flesh will see the salvation of God."},"tc":{"pl":[390],"en":[140]},"g":{"pl":["i","przyszedł","w","całą","krainę","Jordanu","głosząc","chrzest","pokuty","na","odpuszczenie","grzechów","jak","napisane","jest","w","księdze","mów","Izajasza","proroka","głos","wołającego","na","pustyni","przygotujcie","drogę","Pańską","proste","czyńcie","ścieżki","Jego","wszelka","dolina","będzie napełniona","i","wszelka","góra","i","pagórek","będzie zniżony","i","będą","kręte","w","proste","i","nierówne","w","drogi","równe","i","ujrzy","wszelkie","ciało","zbawienie","Boże"],"en":["and","he came","into","all","the country","of the Jordan","preaching","the baptism","of penance","unto","the remission","of sins","as","written","it is","in","the book","of the sayings","of Isaias","the prophet","a voice","of one crying","in","the desert","prepare ye","the way","of the Lord","straight","make ye","the paths","His","every","valley","shall be filled","and","every","mountain","and","hill","shall be brought low","and","shall be","the crooked","into","straight ways","and","the rough","into","ways","plain","and","shall see","all","flesh","the salvation","of God"]},"fn":{"pl":{"w059":"Tu rzeczownik, księga, a nie przymiotnik pod tym samym hasłem słownikowym.","w064":"Imiesłów w dopełniaczu użyty rzeczownikowo: „tego, który woła”.","w085":"Przymiotniki użyte rzeczownikowo: to, co krzywe, ma stać się prostym."},"en":{"w059":"Here the noun, a book, and not the adjective that shares its spelling.","w064":"A genitive participle used as a noun: “of one who is crying”.","w085":"Adjectives standing as nouns: what is crooked is to become straight."}}}]}